{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S11等短停留段仍有较长的感受句，快速扫读时比X的短词更费力，容易顾不上听音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮词能让观众迅速抓住每段叙事支点，完整的话又把人物的动机、犹豫和转变交代清楚；感受文字按音乐时刻出现，也让观众更容易把听到的情绪和故事对应起来。X的短词虽然方便快速掠过，但S03、S07等段落的感受大量堆叠，彼此之间缺少明确的情绪推进关系；Y则把身体反应、声音变化、心理活动和前后情绪落差表达得更具体，整体听读体验更细腻，也更容易理解这个人的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "933ab957-63fc-42fb-bc10-8d9e2cbee8aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031713449457Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:17:53.870968+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "84e5ad0d70bec84a09c633a4ecf431271a0b757ac0595bad0d92f4c35056576c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments